	(CPU_OCTEON2): New macro.
	(OPCODE_IS_MEMBER): Add Octeon2.

2011-11-29  Andrew Pinski  <apinski@cavium.com>

	* mips.h (INSN_CHIP_MASK): Update according to INSN_OCTEONP.
